#: src/prefs.js:75
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

#: src/prefs.js:78
msgid "Sliders"
msgstr "スライダー"

#: src/prefs.js:79
msgid ""
"Every monitor gets its own slider in Quick Settings, next to the volume "
"slider."
msgstr ""
"各モニターにクイック設定の音量スライダーの隣に専用スライダーが付きます。"

#: src/prefs.js:81
msgid "Left of the slider"
msgstr "スライダーの左側"

#: src/prefs.js:82
msgid "Brightness icon"
msgstr "明るさアイコン"

#: src/prefs.js:83
msgid "Monitor number (1, 2, 3…)"
msgstr "モニター番号 (1, 2, 3…)"

#: src/prefs.js:84
msgid "Short name (LG, VS…)"
msgstr "短い名前 (LG, VS…)"

#: src/prefs.js:86
msgid "Show the monitor name on hover"
msgstr "ホバー時にモニター名を表示"

#: src/prefs.js:87
msgid "Replace GNOME’s own brightness slider"
msgstr "GNOME 標準の明るさスライダーを置き換える"

#: src/prefs.js:88
msgid "The laptop screen then gets a row like the other monitors"
msgstr "ノートPCの画面も他のモニターと同じように行が付きます"

#: src/prefs.js:91
msgid "Night Light"
msgstr "夜間モード"

#: src/prefs.js:92
msgid "Add a menu to the Night Light button"
msgstr "夜間モードボタンにメニューを追加"

#: src/prefs.js:93
msgid "Temperature, red screen and its strength"
msgstr "色温度、赤い画面とその強さ"

#: src/prefs.js:99
msgid "Evening"
msgstr "夕方"

#: src/prefs.js:102 src/lib/ui.js:257
msgid "Evening dimming"
msgstr "夕方の減光"

#: src/prefs.js:103
msgid ""
"Turn it on per monitor with the moon button next to its slider. Brightness "
"goes down slowly in the evening and comes back in the morning."
msgstr ""
"スライダー横の月ボタンでモニターごとにオン。夕方にゆっくり暗くなり、朝に戻り"
"ます。"

#: src/prefs.js:105 src/lib/ui.js:264
msgid "Start"
msgstr "開始"

#: src/prefs.js:106
msgid "At sunset"
msgstr "日没時"

#: src/prefs.js:107
msgid "At a fixed time"
msgstr "固定時刻"

#: src/prefs.js:109
msgid "Transition"
msgstr "移行時間"

#: src/prefs.js:109
msgid "Minutes, for both evening and morning"
msgstr "分 (夕方と朝の両方)"

#: src/prefs.js:110 src/prefs.js:111
msgid "Morning"
msgstr "朝"

#: src/prefs.js:110
msgid "Minutes after sunrise"
msgstr "日の出後の分数"

#: src/prefs.js:111
msgid "Brightness comes back at"
msgstr "明るさが戻る時刻"

#: src/prefs.js:117
msgid "For new monitors"
msgstr "新しいモニターの既定値"

#: src/prefs.js:118
msgid "Each monitor can change these in its own menu."
msgstr "各モニターのメニューで変更できます。"

#: src/prefs.js:120
msgid "Minutes after sunset"
msgstr "日没後の分数"

#: src/prefs.js:121
msgid "Start time"
msgstr "開始時刻"

#: src/prefs.js:125 src/lib/ui.js:269
msgid "Night brightness"
msgstr "夜間の明るさ"

#: src/prefs.js:125
msgid "Percent"
msgstr "パーセント"

#: src/prefs.js:134 src/prefs.js:137
msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

#: src/prefs.js:135
msgid ""
"Only used to calculate sunset and sunrise. Automatic uses the location GNOME "
"keeps for Night Light, otherwise your time zone. Nothing is sent anywhere."
msgstr ""
"日没と日の出の計算にのみ使用します。自動: GNOME が夜間モード用に保持している"
"位置、なければタイムゾーン。何も送信されません。"

#: src/prefs.js:138
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "自動"

#: src/prefs.js:139
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手動"

#: src/prefs.js:141
msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "緯度"

#: src/prefs.js:142
msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "経度"

#: src/prefs.js:145
msgid "Today"
msgstr "今日"

#: src/prefs.js:162
msgid "manual"
msgstr "手動"

#: src/prefs.js:163
msgid "GNOME location"
msgstr "GNOME の位置"

#: src/prefs.js:164
#, javascript-format
msgid "time zone %s"
msgstr "タイムゾーン %s"

#: src/prefs.js:165
msgid "UTC offset"
msgstr "UTC オフセット"

#: src/prefs.js:168
#, javascript-format
msgid "Sunset %s · sunrise %s · from %s"
msgstr "日没 %s · 日の出 %s · %s より"

#: src/prefs.js:176
msgid "Screen off"
msgstr "画面オフ"

#: src/prefs.js:179 src/lib/ui.js:293
msgid "Turn off screen"
msgstr "画面をオフ"

#: src/prefs.js:180
msgid "“Turn off screen” and “Turn off others” in each monitor’s menu."
msgstr "各モニターのメニューにある「画面をオフ」と「他をオフ」。"

#: src/prefs.js:182
msgid "Turned off screen"
msgstr "オフにした画面"

#: src/prefs.js:183
msgid "Fully black"
msgstr "完全に黒"

#: src/prefs.js:184
msgid "Lowest light"
msgstr "最小の明るさ"

#: src/prefs.js:186
msgid "Light left"
msgstr "残す明るさ"

#: src/prefs.js:186
msgid "Percent, for “Lowest light”"
msgstr "パーセント (「最小の明るさ」用)"

#: src/prefs.js:188
msgid "Turn back on when the mouse comes"
msgstr "マウスが来たら再点灯"

#: src/prefs.js:189
msgid "Moving the mouse onto a turned off screen brings its light back"
msgstr "オフの画面にマウスを移動すると明るさが戻ります"

#: src/prefs.js:196 src/lib/ui.js:429 src/lib/ui.js:490
msgid "Red screen"
msgstr "赤い画面"

#: src/prefs.js:197
msgid ""
"Switch it on in the Night Light menu. It removes all blue and green light, "
"which helps you fall asleep."
msgstr "夜間モードのメニューでオン。青と緑の光をすべて除き、眠りやすくします。"

#: src/prefs.js:199
msgid "Only while Night Light is active"
msgstr "夜間モード有効時のみ"

#: src/prefs.js:200
msgid "Starts and stops together with Night Light"
msgstr "夜間モードと一緒に開始・終了"

#: src/prefs.js:201 src/lib/ui.js:439
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "強さ"

#: src/prefs.js:215
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "詳細"

#: src/prefs.js:219
msgid ""
"External monitors are controlled over DDC/CI. Your user needs access to /dev/"
"i2c-* (usually the “i2c” group)."
msgstr ""
"外部モニターは DDC/CI で制御します。/dev/i2c-* へのアクセス権 (通常は「i2c」"
"グループ) が必要です。"

#: src/prefs.js:223
msgid "ddcutil found"
msgstr "ddcutil が見つかりました"

#: src/prefs.js:223
msgid "ddcutil not found"
msgstr "ddcutil が見つかりません"

#: src/prefs.js:224
msgid "Install ddcutil from your distribution, then press Scan again"
msgstr ""
"ディストリビューションから ddcutil をインストールし、「再スキャン」を押してく"
"ださい"

#: src/prefs.js:226
msgid "Scan again"
msgstr "再スキャン"

#: src/prefs.js:231
msgid "ddcutil program"
msgstr "ddcutil プログラム"

#: src/prefs.js:234
msgid "Extra arguments"
msgstr "追加の引数"

#: src/prefs.js:237
msgid "Pause between writes"
msgstr "書き込み間隔"

#: src/prefs.js:238
msgid "Milliseconds. Raise it if a monitor misses changes"
msgstr "ミリ秒。モニターが変更を取りこぼす場合は増やしてください"

#: src/prefs.js:242
msgid "Debug messages"
msgstr "デバッグメッセージ"

#: src/prefs.js:242
msgid "Written to the system journal"
msgstr "システムジャーナルに書き込まれます"

#: src/lib/displays.js:37
msgid "Monitor"
msgstr "モニター"

#: src/lib/displays.js:287
msgid "Built-in Display"
msgstr "内蔵ディスプレイ"

#: src/lib/displays.js:288
msgid "Built-in"
msgstr "内蔵"

#: src/lib/displays.js:290
#, javascript-format
msgid "Monitor %d"
msgstr "モニター %d"

#: src/lib/ui.js:119
msgid "Earlier"
msgstr "早く"

#: src/lib/ui.js:122
msgid "Later"
msgstr "遅く"

#: src/lib/ui.js:165
msgid "Evening dimming and more"
msgstr "夕方の減光など"

#: src/lib/ui.js:282
msgid "Extra dimming"
msgstr "追加の減光"

#: src/lib/ui.js:294
msgid "Turn off others"
msgstr "他をオフ"

#: src/lib/ui.js:318
msgid "Off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: src/lib/ui.js:335
msgid "Turned off"
msgstr "オフ"

#: src/lib/ui.js:335
#, javascript-format
msgid "Brightness %s"
msgstr "明るさ %s"

#: src/lib/ui.js:344
#, javascript-format
msgid "Sunset %s %s %d min"
msgstr "日没 %s %s %d 分"

#: src/lib/ui.js:347
msgid "Fixed time"
msgstr "固定時刻"

#: src/lib/ui.js:421
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "色温度"

#: src/lib/ui.js:498
msgid "Sunset to sunrise"
msgstr "日没から日の出まで"

#: src/lib/ui.js:514
msgid "Turns on together with Night Light"
msgstr "夜間モードと一緒にオン"

#: src/lib/ui.js:516
msgid "Starts when Night Light starts"
msgstr "夜間モード開始時に開始"
